# TaijiOS preinstall manifest.
#
# One tab-separated row per application that TaijiOS ships preinstalled. The
# desktop catalog (tools/generate-app-catalog.py --preinstall) and the web root
# builder both read this file, so the shipped set has one source of truth.
#
# Column order, tab-separated, exactly nine columns:
#   1 repo        repository the bundle is built from (org/name, or "taijios"
#                 for a bundle built in this tree)
#   2 bundle      guest path of the installed bundle
#   3 desktop id  basename of the generated .desktop entry, without .desktop
#   4 name        menu name
#   5 icon        icon family name, without the taiji- prefix
#   6 categories  freedesktop category, without the trailing semicolon
#   7 size        bundle size in bytes, empty when the bundle is not present
#   8 sha256      bundle digest, empty when the bundle is not present
#   9 first-run   "root" ships in the first download, "lazy" downloads on
#                 first use
#
# A row is emitted into the catalog only when its bundle exists in the output
# root. A row whose size and sha256 are empty has no bundle in this checkout;
# it is recorded so the set is known, and it emits nothing until one exists.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Sizes and digests below were read from the bundles installed in this tree on
# 2026-11-23. Re-read them whenever a bundle is rebuilt.
#
# repo	bundle	desktop id	name	icon	categories	size	sha256	first-run
